algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm LocalizeAtPrime(F, p):
  for each index i:
    for each torsion factor d in F(i):
      compute v_p(d) = p-adic valuation of d
      if v_p(d) > 0:
        add p^{v_p(d)} to L_p(F)(i).torsion_factors
    L_p(F)(i).free_rank = 0
  return L_p(F)

Complexity: O(n * k * log(d_max))
